BGE-M3 Embedding 與 Chunk 設定位置說明
📍 設定位置總覽
設定項目	主要設定位置	實際使用位置
BGE-M3 Model	.env + bge_embedding_provider.py	Skill 系統專用
PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_SIZE	.env + config.py	File-Based 系統
PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_OVERLAP	.env + config.py	File-Based 系統
Skill Chunk Settings	skill_ingestion_service.py	Skill 系統專用
1️⃣ BGE-M3 Embedding 設定
環境變數 (.env:26-28):
# BGE-M3
EMBEDDING_MODEL_BGE_M3=BAAI/bge-m3
EMBEDDING_DIMENSION_BGE_M3=1024
Provider 實作 (app/Providers/bge_embedding_provider.py:23-34):
class BGEEmbeddingProvider:
    def __init__(self, model_name: str = "BAAI/bge-m3", device: str = None):
        self.model_name = model_name
        self.device = device or ('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'mps' if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else 'cpu')
        self.dimension = 1024  # BGE-M3 has 1024 dimensions
        self.max_sequence_length = 8192  # BGE-M3 supports up to 8192 tokens
關鍵特性:
維度: 1024 維向量
最大長度: 8192 tokens
設備: 自動偵測 CUDA → MPS → CPU
2️⃣ Page-Based Chunk 設定 (File-Based 系統)
環境變數 (.env:60-61):
PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_SIZE=1000 #600
PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_OVERLAP=200 #100
Config 預設值 (app/core/config.py:112-113):
PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_SIZE: int = 2000      # 預設值（會被 .env 覆蓋）
PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_OVERLAP: int = 200
實際使用 (app/Services/input_data_handle_service.py:99-100):
elif settings.CHUNKING_STRATEGY == "page_based":
    self.chunker = PageBasedChunker(
        chunk_size=settings.PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_SIZE,      # ← 使用這裡
        overlap=settings.PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_OVERLAP,      # ← 使用這裡
    )
3️⃣ Skill 系統 Chunk 設定 (獨立於 File-Based)
Skill Ingestion Service (app/SkillServices/skill_ingestion_service.py:55-64):
# Skill-specific chunking configuration
# Skills typically contain conceptual content, use larger chunks
self.chunk_size = chunk_size or getattr(
    settings,
    'SKILL_CHUNK_SIZE',
    1000  # ← Skill 預設 1000（比 File 的 500 大）
)
self.chunk_overlap = chunk_overlap or getattr(
    settings,
    'SKILL_CHUNK_OVERLAP',
    200
)
API Endpoint 覆寫 (app/api/v1/endpoints/skills.py:140-141):
# 在 process_pdf_for_skill 中
ingestion_service = SkillIngestionService(
    chunk_size=1000,     # ← 硬編碼為 1000
    chunk_overlap=200,   # ← 硬編碼為 200
)
📊 設定值總結
系統	Chunk Size	Chunk Overlap	設定來源
File-Based (page_based)	1000	200	.env → settings
File-Based (recursive)	500	50	.env → settings
Skill 系統	1000	200	skill_ingestion_service.py + skills.py
🔧 如何修改設定
修改 Page-Based Chunk (File 系統):
# .env
PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_SIZE=1500     # 改為 1500
PAGE_BASED_CHUNK_OVERLAP=300   # 改為 300
修改 Skill Chunk:
# app/SkillServices/skill_ingestion_service.py:57-63
self.chunk_size = chunk_size or getattr(
    settings,
    'SKILL_CHUNK_SIZE',
    1500  # ← 改這裡
)
self.chunk_overlap = chunk_overlap or getattr(
    settings,
    'SKILL_CHUNK_OVERLAP',
    300   # ← 改這裡
)
或者新增環境變數:
# .env (新增)
SKILL_CHUNK_SIZE=1500
SKILL_CHUNK_OVERLAP=300
